# Built book formats (PDF/EPUB/DOCX).
#
# The PDF and EPUB are attached to the GitHub Release rather than committed: they are
# already-compressed archives that git cannot delta, so every revision would store a
# near-complete copy and grow the repository permanently. README download links point
# at /releases/latest/download/, which always resolves to the current build.
#
# The DOCX is ignored but NOT published. It is the build's own output and the file the
# other two are exported from, so it stays local.
book/*.pdf
book/*.epub
book/*.docx
